### SAP Gateway OData V2 - Create Training Records
### Service: /sap/opu/odata/sap/ZCOURSES_SRV/
### Entity Set: Trainings
### Method: POST (Create new entities)

### Authentication: Basic Auth required
### Replace: YOUR_SERVER, YOUR_CLIENT

@baseUrl = https://YOUR_SERVER:44380/sap/opu/odata/sap/ZCOURSES_SRV
@client = 400
@contentType = application/json

### Training 1: S/4HANA System Migration
